flowchart LR
    Request[User / Agent / Workflow Request]
    Workspace[Cognitive Workspace]
    SelfReg[Self-Regulation Orchestrator]
    SelfModel[Self-Model Store]
    Calibration[Calibration Health Service]
    Humility[Humility Trigger Engine]
    Score[Score Geometry Driver]
    Professor[Professor Review Service]
    Attention[Attention Router]
    Recall[Recall / Source Audit / Probe / Review / Replay]
    Gate[Metamemory Answer Gate]
    Output[Answer Renderer / Tool Executor]
    Outcome[Outcome Observation]
    Ledgers[Prediction Error / Salience / Calibration / Review]

    Request --> Workspace
    Workspace --> SelfReg
    SelfReg <--> SelfModel
    SelfReg <--> Calibration
    SelfReg <--> Humility
    SelfReg <--> Score
    SelfReg -->|when required| Professor
    Professor --> SelfReg
    SelfReg --> Attention
    Attention --> Recall
    Recall --> Gate
    SelfReg --> Gate
    Gate --> Output
    Output --> Outcome
    Outcome --> Ledgers
    Ledgers --> Calibration
    Ledgers --> SelfModel
